<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Application Approved</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f6f9;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #333333;
        }
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background: #ffffff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
        }
        .email-header {
            background-color: #2a9d8f;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 24px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .email-header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        .email-body {
            padding: 30px;
        }
        .email-body p {
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            color: #555555;
        }
        .doctor-name {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #222222;
        }
        .success-box {
            background-color: #e9f5f3;
            border-left: 4px solid #2a9d8f;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 20px 0;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        .success-box p {
            margin: 0;
            color: #1d6f64;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #2a9d8f;
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            border-radius: 4px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 20px 0;
        }
        .email-footer {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #888888;
            border-top: 1px solid #eeeeee;
        }
        .support-link {
            color: #2a9d8f;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="email-container">
        <!-- Header -->
        <div class="email-header">
            <h1>Application Approved from <% = appName %></h1>
        </div>

        <!-- Body -->
        <div class="email-body">
            <p>Dear Dr. <span class="doctor-name"><%= doctorName %></span>,</p>
            
            <p>Congratulations! We are thrilled to inform you that your application to join the <span class="doctor-name"><%= appName || 'Smart Healthcare Limited' %></span> network has been successfully approved after a thorough review of your professional credentials.</p>
            
            <div class="success-box">
                <p><strong>Status:</strong> Your account is now active, and you have full access to start connecting with patients and managing consultations.</p>
            </div>

            <p>You can now log in to your dashboard using your registered credentials to complete your profile setup, set your availability, and configure your consultation preferences.</p>

            <% if (locals.loginUrl) { %>
                <div style="text-align: center;">
                    <a href="<%= loginUrl %>" class="cta-button">Access Your Dashboard</a>
                </div>
            <% } %>

            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance navigating the platform, please feel free to reach out to our support team at <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail || 'support@example.com' %>" class="support-link"><%= supportEmail || 'support@example.com' %></a>.</p>

            <p>We look forward to a wonderful collaboration and are excited to have you on board!</p>

            <p>Warm regards,<br>
            <strong><%= teamName || 'Credentialing & Support Team' %></strong><br>
            <%= appName || 'Smart Healthcare Limited' %></p>
        </div>

        <!-- Footer -->
        <div class="email-footer">
            <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> <%= appName || 'Smart Healthcare Limited' %>. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>